{"3627510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Geo Blaster", "steam_appid": 3627510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geo Blaster is a shape-based arena shooter featuring fast movement and a powerful arsenal of weapons. Blast through high-intensity levels packed with platforming, secrets, power-ups, and a wide range of unique geometric enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through geometry and mathematics-themed worlds via portals. Complete all three worlds to confront the source of the disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed By Scrapbox Software.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Geo Blaster is a shape-based arena shooter featuring fast movement and a powerful arsenal of weapons. Blast through high-intensity levels packed with platforming, secrets, power-ups, and a wide range of unique geometric enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through geometry and mathematics-themed worlds via portals. Complete all three worlds to confront the source of the disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed By Scrapbox Software.</p>", "short_description": "Geo Blaster is a fast-paced geometry-based arena FPS. Run, platform, and shoot through shape-themed worlds filled with action, platforming, secrets, and power-ups. Battle unique geometric enemies across math-inspired worlds and confront the source of the disorder. Developed By Scrapbox Software.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627510/743eabf045d513b9205d2a6403716adaebed181e/header.jpg?t=1775797860", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627510/7bf661f27dcf6ea2428773afecc52187ceabf79a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775797860", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3